THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES
===================

This file lists the direct third-party runtime dependencies currently declared
in pfp-public/pyproject.toml for the Product Feed Protocol (PFP) staging
package.

Scope of this notice
--------------------

- This file covers direct runtime dependencies declared in the main dependency
  section of pyproject.toml.
- Optional dependencies are listed separately by extra group.
- Development and test-only dependencies are not listed here, because Story 1
  is establishing the public repository root pack rather than a full build or
  CI compliance inventory.
- License data below was checked against upstream project license texts or
  project license declarations available from the corresponding upstream
  package/repository pages.

Required runtime dependencies
-----------------------------

1. PyYAML
   - Role in this project: YAML parsing and emission for runtime configuration.
   - Upstream license: MIT License.

2. pydantic
   - Role in this project: typed data validation and runtime model contracts.
   - Upstream license: MIT License.

3. ijson
   - Role in this project: iterative JSON parsing for streaming and low-memory
     ingestion paths.
   - Upstream license: BSD 3-Clause License.
   - Note: the upstream ijson license file also includes additional notice text
     for bundled YAJL-related components.

